
book math
  task square
    take x, like u64
    send back, call mul
      bind a, read x
      bind b, read x

  task cube
    take x, like u64
    send back, call mul
      bind a, read x
      bind b, call mul
        bind a, read x
        bind b, read x

book string
  task greet
    take name, like text
    send back, text <hello>
